# FURUI blind-01: the commitment to the held-out answers, anchored before opening

**Status:** a commitment record, anchored to the JIDEC ledger before blind-01 is opened. It names only public digests; the answers and the item texts stay sealed until opening.

    repository        ogasurfproject-jpg/hs-furui-private (private), commit ca77c3c67ff92b890e8d39a822056e9cf7044d87
